      <abstract>
        <p>This is a placeholder abstract. The document demonstrates the
features of a Quarto manuscript project that renders a RevTeX PDF:
author and affiliation metadata, numbered sections and equations,
cross-references, citations, and figures generated from Python code.</p>
      </abstract>
